  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "sentence": "Piano plunks resonated from opposite ends of the immense drill hall at the Park Avenue Armory.",
      "paragraph_id": 0,
      "word_count": 16,
      "start_time": 0.0,
      "end_time": 6.95,
      "duration": 6.95,
      "phoneme_count": 98
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "sentence": "Each time a key was struck, the pitch inched higher and higher.",
      "paragraph_id": 0,
      "word_count": 12,
      "start_time": 6.95,
      "end_time": 11.175,
      "duration": 4.225,
      "phoneme_count": 57
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "sentence": "It was Saturday afternoon, and technicians were at work, equipped with tools like a felt ribbon and a wrench, to tune the pianos as quickly as possible.",
      "paragraph_id": 1,
      "word_count": 27,
      "start_time": 11.175,
      "end_time": 21.9,
      "duration": 10.725,
      "phoneme_count": 152
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "sentence": "Each one, made by Hailun, had more than 200 strings, all of which needed to be tuned to specific frequencies using an app called TuneLab.",
      "paragraph_id": 1,
      "word_count": 25,
      "start_time": 21.9,
      "end_time": 32.175,
      "duration": 10.275,
      "phoneme_count": 146
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "sentence": "Once the tuners were satisfied, they moved on to another piano.",
      "paragraph_id": 2,
      "word_count": 11,
      "start_time": 32.175,
      "end_time": 37.175,
      "duration": 5.0,
      "phoneme_count": 64
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "sentence": "And then another.",
      "paragraph_id": 2,
      "word_count": 3,
      "start_time": 37.175,
      "end_time": 39.025,
      "duration": 1.85,
      "phoneme_count": 18
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "sentence": "And another.",
      "paragraph_id": 2,
      "word_count": 2,
      "start_time": 39.025,
      "end_time": 40.675,
      "duration": 1.65,
      "phoneme_count": 13
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "sentence": "In all, they had 50 pianos to prepare for the North American premiere a few days later of Georg Friedrich Haas\u2019s \u201c11,000 Strings,\u201d running at the Armory through Oct. 7.",
      "paragraph_id": 2,
      "word_count": 30,
      "start_time": 40.675,
      "end_time": 53.65,
      "duration": 12.975,
      "phoneme_count": 182
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "sentence": "Haas calls for the instruments to be arranged in a vast circle, surrounding about 1,300 seats.",
      "paragraph_id": 3,
      "word_count": 16,
      "start_time": 53.65,
      "end_time": 61.25,
      "duration": 7.6,
      "phoneme_count": 114
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "sentence": "The 25 players of the ensemble Klangforum Wien are dotted throughout, in front of every other piano.",
      "paragraph_id": 3,
      "word_count": 17,
      "start_time": 61.25,
      "end_time": 69.05,
      "duration": 7.8,
      "phoneme_count": 107
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "sentence": "On Saturday, the layout was in place, but the pianos were a work in progress.",
      "paragraph_id": 3,
      "word_count": 15,
      "start_time": 69.05,
      "end_time": 74.975,
      "duration": 5.925,
      "phoneme_count": 79
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "sentence": "Sisi Ye, Hailun\u2019s artistic director, said that tuning for \u201c11,000 Strings\u201d takes about 20 hours.",
      "paragraph_id": 3,
      "word_count": 15,
      "start_time": 74.975,
      "end_time": 83.2,
      "duration": 8.225,
      "phoneme_count": 112
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "sentence": "It\u2019s one thing to tune 50 pianos.",
      "paragraph_id": 4,
      "word_count": 7,
      "start_time": 83.2,
      "end_time": 86.25,
      "duration": 3.05,
      "phoneme_count": 38
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "sentence": "It\u2019s another to tune them for this piece, which demands that no two instruments sound the same.",
